  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cook Islands Monitoring and Evaluation Systems Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GEI has developed a Monitoring and Evaluation Systems Analysis tool - MESA. The MESA tool is a diagnostic tool used to analyze the MEL situation in countries that are initiating MEL capacity strengthening processes. This tool will be used to generate a high level, strategic overview of the Cook Islands&apos; MEL system, and identify the opportunities to strengthen it for improved performance, accountability and impact.</narrative>
  </description>
